<title>Cabo Delgado, Mozambique: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mozambique/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mozambique-2026-11-09T06:56:58.233Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 06:56:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant Islamist insurgents in Cabo Delgado have intensified attacks, killing a woman and a blogger while livestreaming the assault and later releasing captured fishermen in a hostage episode. Insurgents also struck the Maconde region, expanding the geographic scope of violence. Qatar and Mozambique held political consultations on the crisis, and Russia noted updated bilateral relations with Mozambique. Alarm has risen over growing synthetic drug manufacturing linked to Kenya, Nigeria and Mozambique. The conflict caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168729&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBrckd2V1JMLWpNY2NBd0ZjaV9PRTlvU2JvM3ZrNUZqTDB1cXhKM2EwZWVKN2E2eElEdGRtSWxFTk9fZzRYVE1zSW5JdjdPVWdaTURWMjVXQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNZGJBT3FvNkxsNm9KTzM4dTV4eHF4ZjdMaWxhOU9aaTJpVl9IbjBDOVJXWS1jUUtqd25MbHh2Q3Fod21uejdhYW1GSUJRcmlQRVBWYjNJU294WmUzZ2s5dC1qUC1FVnVjakV0ZjZlazhWVFZiSFA2MGhzNWNKMnZLRDREcEU0dmpmYTgxWkdPRkQ0QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxQRVdEaUptSHhIel9fMG9ISm1KSklDMzg4aF9abWdCU25LRWRGRnZCOUtDbW1jdFRYUTAtMEFYcDRxTXR1eXdaZENtQUIwYW55Qkh1V3p6WktWSUhqVzM0dTJWaDBLWXZGWDJPb3dIOVlMLXhWQWhySzF5LTdTelNwc3ZBb3RsdjhMMjVZZmw2dDNwcTNNVVhWaWxTMVQwZTczbXV2c3pHR3FDZFBscFRRNnIxejMtdWVDSzUycmxmVF9kTnBwYUlhRFR3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNeTk3THVEZldXWWs3SnkyV0Rfd1puS2ZMRktpeWxGbzhtTEwwNEkzOWlER2JNcllwOC1Ub1NIT3h5aGM1ZHg5dS1CZUlsUUZ4TFVLNGNfTzZzRlVrcU9xZGNPaTlBMWNycXpIYjBIc3lDWW1aNDFodVZLZ0tLTVZ2bUlKMmNCMldMRUNJaHB5a0J5MXdKMkhfSEJhdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Br